      "uid": "zhcn:e5992088afcd40e744e7145c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "格斗技",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca9ab3ca2933e28275ffc217ffc9f56a13912fda1bbf26628fa96a5a561ffe9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "138",
        "99"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06120801c2248b942213cb8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "佩服！　两人的关系\\n是多么的理想啊……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc1a7f2f3d5e4ca133e8dd2f6a7fa84d72851d87ab5b6414b2898c34037b170e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ff6a3ff763f16411239c219",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原来如此。此等实力……\\n果然不是只会耍嘴皮子而已啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d974c3fce29e8eb4b747557f82e41fce9cb472bcfa2254a8f9ec2ea8143c7ac3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb5f212516ee8900a400bdf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从今往后，也请你负起训练员的责任，\\n以热忱之心与赛马娘诚挚来往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69fc480177a7c5408e7d6a68ecbfad9510a78a955824d04e1d59ac89f5601242",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4c5798244384ef19251576",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望你今后的表现也能不辱特雷森之名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1638bbbbae75ed43e99b7b6a24f40d8adc9150a57426be2837d3539b4476fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20653fd306783b0bce07e4b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近每次来观摩都会令我着迷。\\n……着迷于各位所散发的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8aa264767e985c2038607507c454387d75aca4529a7cf03d574be9813d1e48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da66328e7c7f22dcfcfa7c17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完成度又更高了……！\\n真不愧是训练员呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e25dd09cd1268caebbbaab2c712a9e2bf82274ae9255765390da47998e63a17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3731ef69e0c3bb3769555b35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来日积月累的努力\\n有确实为她所吸收！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac763a8b9341802b065ae02dd6b6726110a053cf6d9280475f42ac438885d761",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af4cf3e0cbf89b41b3a8778",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果有什么我能帮上忙的地方，\\n请不要客气尽管告诉我喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b58dad4e14ea2bf563354f361418c3648a4b625cb186b944b4f3d5d354199a3f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d07807ea6005494d6a38df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "优秀！\\n期待能有更上一层楼的活跃表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6dabd4fe1396b4b7357f16b8e7a940a60ec29a1792254d33f762ef64b91bc17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0005d56a762693b314ee6d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的……非常以你们为傲！\\n你们正可说是──梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afbd2231d5e3ec385cb1038ab64ac33893fff62f9b3853b2730043b0b4d9f8fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a447173ab530055fe8681719",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喜悦与烦恼都能共有共享。\\n对彼此而言都是无可取代的伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e3eed5e5aef1d7d24fd621143ce0ef6d35d035a2608c3d71223dc9e5dfea0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f8e7ebbe481318423ce8d53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "似乎与专任建立起良好关系了呢。\\n不错不错，很棒喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b615bec229064de01f7e7f09a0f445abb6e8196a31439b4088e55ee382b69f8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ada67c09a8c545f734c604",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有什么烦恼吗？\\n有什么事都可以来谈谈喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c15fcedbcc9928ad5069b6fcdce5b4066e48cac9706ce325217a4019834e8f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e578efb4f8557f10c70fd2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感動とは……貴方たちのような\\n強い絆から生まれるのですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b90beb22e477b85421fb87e4f64980dc4145fba6b1e2f97b8215f9d64b37bb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ba38bf8373df451634ae61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大変ご活躍のようですね……！\\n私個人としても応援しています。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec74d348bdbb5252c8e57093ff3027379fac9591c4bb017720be183e8ed1aa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ffeee7773cb8ed8d844139",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "お二人が共有する熱意……\\n私もそれに、倣おうと思います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5003a0b0505f8ca92c86ef9b89d75285d71b85b9828a9ae98f37abd23490bddc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f2441b6e7fe901fbc85adc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相談したいことがございましたら\\nいつでも仰ってくださいね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "664c97e03d39f11ae627531dddd1183b4215bbf41e7987095107c628216303b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644c37e5be0a1704e0dd034d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我感觉到了，感受到了啊！\\n灵魂燃烧的声音！达哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc78b6a33dad4a039ad75058f04b60a38c1f180e2783cd82dde4758602e8daa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf7655a7dcbf203f5eeced8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不错！　实力似乎\\n渐渐增长了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fc749db6212824759642712437022d8454375b611f958d59daa71f265583c2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f27e8e4efe9e72ea45e89007",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的活跃传闻连无人岛上都常听到！\\n哎呀，真是！完全超出我的预想啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5593926ffdd27d6687c8412a1cf3645e670a02e6f23843b4782532de7443171",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc52d510210a3f4b80dcd26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看起来你很努力啊！\\n好，下顿伙食我就给你加个菜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab33a986151ddc7df91ffee4ed4ffafb440418d9e8b81c06a48565a9d788397e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c0e2679f4d642759d8ea1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哟哟！最近怎么样啊！\\n尽管冲吧，一路奔跑到终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd37b94e8a8523d0ecede558a45aee480bfb0e05ccd4022615fa7cf5fd59d20c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbe951faf0a2c9539879a0a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鼓励！　期待今后的\\n成长哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "344bcbe0169b5f2a57744fddd75ced3348e7b59a7ebfb6ba4046f79ac5a0b03d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:886d486e85a00446d0ea664d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种成长速度……灿烂的眼神……\\n啊啊！　真是太～～棒了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab78ccc90be1695d70b6e28c14cdad6cd28f4229a1468b91a7030cf40a85c1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f47107b276bd1bd69402bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能代表赛马界的\\n就属这对赛马娘与训练员了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1429286b326e029eba16ff21c76c1f36788eb84c8672dc66cc88aab2912f6c83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112f558d96d9e678d0136c1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "差不多该写篇\\n专题报导了吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e72f044f937439bf404889eb5466e672ae7edb7f8ecc54bcb2fecfc5c70f87f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "139",
        "7"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
